      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Todd invite you to this wonderful property located on the Dublin Road in Tuam. This spacious residence is a 5-bedroom two-storey town home situated on the Dublin Road close to Tuam town centre, offering a perfect blend of comfort and convenience.\n\nAs we explore this property, you'll notice its prime location on a generous plot of land.\n\nThe property itself is in excellent condition, making it ready for immediate occupancy. Upon entering, you'll find a welcoming hallway that leads to two reception rooms, providing ample space for relaxation, entertainment, or perhaps a home office. The very specious living room is a perfect space to relax and unwind. The kitchen/dining area is designed for both practicality and style, offering a central hub for culinary endeavours and family gatherings.\n\nThe bathroom is well-equipped and designed for comfort, while the utility room adds practicality to daily living. A carpet stairs leads you to five double bedrooms. A noteworthy feature of this property is its large-sized south-facing garden located to the rear. This outdoor space with patio is perfect for enjoying sunny days, gardening, or entertaining guests.\n\nIn terms of location, the property boasts easy access to Tuam town centre, ensuring that essential amenities such as the church, post office, shopping facilities, excellent schools, and sports grounds are all within easy reach. The vibrant community of Tuam contributes to the overall appeal of this residence.\n\nFurthermore, its strategic location makes Galway City a mere 30-minute drive away, and Knock Airport is just 40 minutes away, adding to the convenience for those who may need to travel.\n\nIn conclusion, this 5-bedroom town home on the Dublin Road in Tuam offers a harmonious blend of comfort, convenience, and natural beauty. Whether you're looking for a peaceful retreat or a family home with easy access to amenities and nearby cities, this property is indeed a fantastic option. Qualifies for the vacancy grant. All enquiries to Sherry FitzGerald Todd 09326622"
